{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122050047829-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122081032\"/><p>涉事的中菜館。(梁國雄攝)</p><p>灣仔發生火警。今日(22日)清晨4時53分，執法部門接獲多人報案，指謝斐道392-402號地下一間小菜館冒出大量濃煙，曾傳出兩次爆炸聲。救援人員接報到場，人員打破玻璃門，開喉入內灌救，至清晨5時28分已將火救熄，事件中毋須疏散，沒有人受傷，起火原因有待調查中。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T00:20:14.093349+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T21:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:13:48.132053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T00:13:48.132053+00:00","content_hash":"9ca2b6d4c74137f9838ec1fdc0b5836f34346704ca37751660748540f7ee0a84","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}